# Opening turns at a four-player table: phases, a master card and the first transfers.
# Cards are given by VEKN ID, so this file holds no card data: names and images come from the
# content pack (LEGAL-08). Positions such as A:hand:4 follow from the seed.
seed 3
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
seat D dave
crypt A 200107 *3 200848 *3 200734 *3 200106 *3
library A 101055 *10 100845 *8 100401 *8 100984 *6 100598 *4 100518 *4
crypt B 200534 *4 200842 *4 200117 *4
library B 100573 *10 100518 *10 100401 *10 100908 *10
crypt C 200378 *6 200107 *6
library C 100001 *10 101321 *10 100845 *10 100984 *10
crypt D 200106 *6 200848 *6
library D 100598 *10 102137 *10 101743 *10 100059 *10
start

# Everyone starts with 30 pool, 4 crypt cards face down and 7 cards in hand.
expect pool A 30
expect count A:uncontrolled 4
expect count A:hand 7
expect turn 1 A unlock

# Alice's turn. The unlock phase has nothing to do yet.
A> next
expect turn 1 A master
# A master card in the master phase: a location, so it stays in play. It is replaced.
A> play A:hand:4 ready
expect count A:ready 1
expect count A:hand 7
A> next
expect turn 1 A minion
# No minions in play yet, so on to influence: the first player gets one transfer.
A> next
expect turn 1 A influence
A> transfer +1 A:uncontrolled:3
expect pool A 29
expect card A:uncontrolled:3 blood 1
A> next
A> next

# Bob's turn: a master card of his own, then two transfers onto one vampire.
expect turn 2 B unlock
B> next
B> play B:hand:2 ready
B> next
B> next
B> transfer +2 B:uncontrolled:2
expect card B:uncontrolled:2 blood 2
expect pool B 28
B> next
B> next

# Carol's turn: three transfers, spread over two vampires.
expect turn 3 C unlock
C> next
C> next
C> next
C> transfer +2 C:uncontrolled:1
C> transfer +1 C:uncontrolled:2
expect pool C 27
C> next
C> next

# Dave's turn: four transfers. From now on everyone gets four.
expect turn 4 D unlock
D> next
D> next
D> next
D> transfer +4 D:uncontrolled:1
expect pool D 26
D> next
D> next
expect turn 5 A unlock
